{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_31","type":"agent_message","text":"The main behavior is now wired: persisted `visible` and `available` are independent, shopper detail/list queries exclude only hidden products, unavailable products remain readable but are blocked from cart addition, and checkout validation detects products hidden after they entered a cart. I’m compiling now to catch API/version issues and then I’ll adjust any failures."}}
